  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up orange fleshed sweetpotato through the International Potato Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK will provide &#xA3;12m as funding to the International Potato Centre (CIP) over a five year period (2013-2018).  This will enable the scale up of nutritionally improved (or biofortified) Orange Fleshed Sweet Potatoes (OFSP) to 1.2 million farming households in 4 countries in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
